			"notes": "# New Maven\nTo use the new maven, add\n```java\n    maven {\n        name = \"Digitalunderworlds\"\n        url = \"https://maven.digitalunderworlds.com/releases\"\n    }\n    // For SNAPSHOT releases, such as this one\n    maven {\n        name = \"Digitalunderworlds Snapshots\"\n        url = \"https://maven.digitalunderworlds.com/snapshots\"\n    }\n```\nTo your `repositories` block,\n\nThen you can use `implementation fg.deobf(\"net.realdarkstudios:rdslib:${rdslib_ver}\")` in your `dependencies` block\n\n## Maven Snippets:\n1.19.2: `net.realdarkstudios:rdslib:1.0.3.0-SNAPSHOT-rc3`\n1.19.3: `net.realdarkstudios:rdslib:2.0.3.0-SNAPSHOT-rc3`\n1.19.4: `net.realdarkstudios:rdslib:3.0.3.0-SNAPSHOT-rc3`\n1.20(.1): `net.realdarkstudios:rdslib:4.0.3.0-SNAPSHOT-rc3`\n\n## Changelog\n- Updated Versioning Scheme\n  - OLD: `1.20.X-forge-0.0.3.0-rc3`\n  - NEW: `4.0.3.0-rc3`\n    - 1.19.2 -> 1\n    - 1.19.3 -> 2\n    - 1.19.4 -> 3\n    - 1.20(.1) -> 4\n- Group ID is now `net.realdarkstudios`\n- Added Digitalunderworlds Maven support\n\n- Custom Furnaces V3\n- Deprecated CFV1 and CFV2 classes\n- Returned Rarities to their initial form (no longer requiring a registry)\n- Add `CustomRarityBlockItem`"
